        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217326?u=a4cdaefc3a39658f4d104b96ec8c78f10ac63d12&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Restructure the X-Content-Type-Options page to explain both behaviors of <code class=\"notranslate\">nosniff</code>:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Request blocking</strong> for script/style destinations (Fetch spec)</li>\n<li><strong>MIME type sniffing disabled</strong> for other response types including HTML documents (MIME Sniffing spec)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Fix the misleading NOTE that implied <code class=\"notranslate\">nosniff</code> only applies to script/style request blocking</li>\n<li>Update the <code class=\"notranslate\">nosniff</code> directive description to cover both behaviors</li>\n<li>Add guidance that servers should always send an accurate Content-Type</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41745.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3570561352\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41745\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41745/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41745\">#41745</a><br>\nContinues the work from <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3579550511\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41776\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41776/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41776\">#41776</a>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Test plan</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Spec links to Fetch and MIME Sniffing specifications resolve correctly</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Description accurately reflects both spec behaviors</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> No grammar issues (fixes \"only apply\" → restructured)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">🤖 Generated with <a href=\"https://claude.com/claude-code\" rel=\"nofollow\">Claude Code</a></p>",
