        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36379249?u=4840c2d79361800483d4c22b03d928ae33115103&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Unlike <code class=\"notranslate\">:active-view-transition-type(&lt;custom-ident&gt;#)</code>, the <code class=\"notranslate\">types</code> descriptor for <code class=\"notranslate\">@view-transition</code> takes values <code class=\"notranslate\">none | &lt;custom-ident&gt;+</code>. The <code class=\"notranslate\">types</code> values should be space separated.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">types</code> descriptor syntax: <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-view-transitions-2/#types-cross-doc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-view-transitions-2/#types-cross-doc</a></li>\n</ul>",
