        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF149 adds support for <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSSNumericValue/to\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">CSSNumericValue.to()</code></a> behind the pref <code class=\"notranslate\">layout.css.typed-om.enabled</code> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013251\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013251</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the docs for the method, which were somewhat incorrect based on the spec (incorrect return type, spec language that didn't mean anything to a normal reader).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3978051479\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43211\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43211/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43211\">#43211</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43426",
            "title": "CSSNumericalValue.to() fixes",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-13T07:39:08.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-13T05:12:03.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF149 adds support for <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSSNumericValue/to\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">CSSNumericValue.to()</code></a> behind the pref <code class=\"notranslate\">layout.css.typed-om.enabled</code> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013251\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013251</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is part of bigger work to implement the features in the CSS Typed Object Model Level 1 specification.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds and experimental features page and release note entry.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3978051479\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43211\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43211/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43211\">#43211</a></p>",
